0	section	Sergeant Hudson
1	line	Player	Are you Sergeant Hudson?
1	line	Sergeant Hudson	That's right. What do you need?
1	line	Player	Betty said you were the one in charge of the investigation into her father's murder. I was wondering if I could help.
1	line	Sergeant Hudson	Well, thank you for the offer, but we've got this in hand.
1	line	Player	Betty doesn't seem to feel that way. She doesn't think you care.
1	line	Sergeant Hudson	The girl has just lost her father. Of course she's going to be emotional right now. She has nothing to fear though. We'll get to the bottom of this.
1	line	Player	Perhaps you'll get to the bottom of it faster with an extra pair of hands. I could be quite useful.
1	line	Sergeant Hudson	Hmm... Well if it makes Betty feel better, then fine. Feel free to have a look around the house. Just don't go messing up any evidence.
1	action	end
