1	option	Do you know why someone would want your father dead?
2	line	Player	Do you know why someone would want your father dead?
2	line	Betty	Maybe... but... it surely can't be possible...
2	line	Player	What is it?
2	line	Betty	It was a long time ago, when I was just a child. My mother and sister were murdered, right here in Land's End, but they never found the killer...
2	line	Betty	My father used to be a judge you see. A lot of criminals would have considered him an enemy. Most likely one of them killed my family to get to him.
2	line	Betty	But that was so long ago... Could they really have come back now?
2	line	Player	Hopefully not, but we can't rule anything out at this point.
2	action	other
