0	section	Talking to Lan the Butcher
1	line	Lan the Butcher	What d'ya want?
1	line	Player	I'm looking into the murder that happened just up the road. I wanted to ask you a few questions.
1	line	Lan the Butcher	Oh... I guess tha's okay...
1	select	Select an option
1	option	What do you know about the victim?
2	line	Player	What do you know about the victim?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Well... er... he didn't used to live 'ere all the time. I think this was his holiday home or somethin' like that. Then 'bout ten years ago he moved here permanently.
2	line	Player	And you were living here back then as well?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Yup. I've been runnin' me butchers here for a long time. A long time indeed...
2	line	Player	You must have interacted with each other quite a bit then in that time?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Nope. He kept 'imself to 'imself. I like to do the same. It's nice an' peaceful here. No disturbances. You can get on with things without people botherin' you.
2	line	Player	Business must be slow if you're running a butchers in a quiet place like this. Especially given you don't seem to have much product around...
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Heh! I don't keep it up here, do I? It's all down in the basement. I keep it there, that I do.
2	line	Player	What basement?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	...
2	line	Player	...
2	line	Lan the Butcher	...
2	line	Player	Maybe I should take a look around...
2	action	other
1	option	Did you see or hear anything around the time of the murder?
2	line	Player	Did you see or hear anything around the time of the murder?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Nope. I was sleepin'. Guess that's what he's doing now, heh!
2	line	Player	You find murder funny?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	No... Was just sayin', I was...
2	action	other
1	option	Do you know why someone would want the victim dead?
2	line	Player	Do you know why someone would want the victim dead?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Maybe his daughter killed him 'cause he was snoring too loud?
2	line	Player	That doesn't seem likely...
2	line	Lan the Butcher	No? It's a very small house for two people. I wouldn't blame her if she'd got a bit sick of 'im.
2	line	Player	So you can't think of any actual reason why someone would want him dead?
2	line	Lan the Butcher	Nope. I think he was some big important somebody up in Shayzien once, but that was a long time ago. By the end he was just a nobody. Forgotten. Just like the rest of us...
2	action	other
1	option	I found this knife under your bed...
