2	line	Kyle	Old man.
2	line	Player	Did you see much of him?
2	line	Kyle	No.
2	line	Player	But you did know him?
2	line	Kyle	A little. Seen him picking berries before.
2	line	Player	And that's it?
2	line	Kyle	Yup.
