2	line	Player	What was it?
2	line	Kyle	Person in a hood.
2	line	Player	What were they doing?
2	line	Kyle	Running away from the house.
2	line	Player	Anything else you can tell me about them?
2	line	Kyle	Slender build.
2	action	other
1	option	Do you know why someone would want the victim dead?
2	line	Player	Do you know why someone would want the victim dead?
2	line	Kyle	Yup.
2	line	Player	You do?
2	line	Kyle	He was important once. Put criminals away... or killed them.
2	line	Player	Anything more specific?
2	line	Kyle	No.
2	action	other
